<title>JAPAN: Wako Sec shares bid-only on speculation.</title>
<headline>Wako Sec shares bid-only on speculation.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Wako Securities Co Ltd stood bid-only on Wednesday afternoon, prompted by speculation raised by recent buying by a foreign securities house.</p>
<p>As of 0518 GMT, the share price was quoted at 510 yen, up from Tuesday's closing price of 472 yen.  </p>
<p>Wako Securities told Reuters on Wednesday that a company, which they understand to be a U.S. trust bank, bought a little more than five percent of Wako's shares but that they think it was a pure investment.</p>
</text>
